  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=plastic&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>Костяное снаряжение</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Костяная броня, инструменты, меч и конская броня могут быть изготовлены из костей!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Прочнее камня, но чуть хуже железа.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Прочность - 190<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Эффективность - 5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Урон при атаке - 4,5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Способность к заклинаниям - 9</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Рейтинги брони - 10 (1,3,4,2)<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Способность к заклинаниям для брони - 15</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Рейтинг конской брони - 4</span></li>\n</ul>\n\nСодержание описывает модификацию, ресурсный пакет, модпак или шейдер для Minecraft, либо другие связанные с игрой ресурсы. Пожалуйста, сохраняйте стиль языка приятным для геймеров.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/912/bone_horizontal_line.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Скачать</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/905/forgeicon.png\"></span></a></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3843052\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-1.19-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"127\" height=\"30\"></a><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3697349\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.2-green?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3543403\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.1-yellowgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3403465\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.1-yellow?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3421008\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.5-orange?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/904/fabricicon.png\"></a></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\nСодержание посвящено моду, ресурс-паку, модпаку или шейдер-паку для Minecraft, а также другим связанным с Minecraft ресурсам. Пожалуйста, сохраняйте стиль изложения приятным для геймеров.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/4398961\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-1.19.4-blue?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\"></a><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/4398961\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.3-teal?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/4062550\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.2-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3874774\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19-green?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\"></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment/files/3697350\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.2-yellowgreen?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></span><span style